{"strongs": "H7892", "word": "שִׁיר", "translit": "shir", "root": "שיר", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "song", "definition": "שִׁיר 77 noun masculine song (Late Hebrew id. ; so Eccl 40:21 +); — ׳ שׁ absolute Judg 5:12 +, construct 2Chr 29:27 +; suffix שִׁירִי Ps 28:7 , etc.; plural שִׁירִים 1Chr 13:8 ; Song 1:1 שִׁרִים Gen 31:27 ; Prov 25:20 suffix שִׁרֶ֫יךָ Amos 5:23 , etc.; — 1. lyric song , + מָשָׁל 1Kgs 5:12 , opposed to קִינָה Amos 8:10 joyous Gen 31:27 ( J ) Isa 30:29 עגבים ׳ שׁ Ezek 33:32 triumphal Judg 5:12 love song Song 1:1 (twice in verse) (title שִׁיר הַשִּׁירִים ), Ps 45:1 ( שִׁיר יְדִידֹת ); noisy Amos 5:23 ; Ezek 26:13 , in drunken revels Isa 24:9 , compare Isa 23:16 כסילים ׳ שׁ Eccl 7:5 not for sorrow Prov 25:20 ; Ps 137:3 (twice in verse); בְּנוֺת הַשִּׁיר Eccl 12:4 songstresses (probably birds). 2. religious song , in worship, || תפלה Ps 42:9 usually praise, הלל בשׁיר Ps 69:31 מִשִּׁירִי אֲהוֺדֶנּוּ Ps 28:7 שִׁרִ תְּהִלָּה וְהוֺדוֺת Neh 12:46 ׳ שׁיר י Ps 137:4 ; 2Chr 29:27 שׁיר חדשׁ Isa 42:10 (fresh outburst), + 6 t., see חָדָשׁ ; in Psalm-titles, שׁיר Isa 46:1 , compare Isa 26:1 שׁיר המעלות pilgrim songs Ps 120:1 + 14 t. (see II. מַעִַלָה p.752); with מִמְוֺר Ps 48:1 + 12 t. (see ׳ מִז p. 274); מַשְׁכִּיל שִׁיר Ps 45:1 ( ׳ שׁ originally alone in all except Ps 30:1 ; Ps 92:1 ; Ps 108:1 , see Br JBL xviii (1899), 138 ). 3. specifically song of Levitical choirs, with musical accompare , 1Chr 6:16 ; 1Chr 6:17 ; 1Chr 13:8 (so read also || 2Sam 6:5 for בְּרוֺשִׁים , ᵐ5 Th and modern, compare ׳ ב ), 1Chr 25:6 ; 1Chr 25:7 ; 2Chr 23:18 ; 2Chr 29:28 ; Neh 12:27 כלי (ה)שׁיר instrument to accompany song 1Chr 15:16 + 6 t. (see כְּלִי 2 b ); compare Amos 6:5 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8643')\">BDB8643</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7892')\">H7892</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8642')\">BDB8642</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8644')\">BDB8644</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שִׁיר</bdbheb><sub>77</sub> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>song</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; so <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Eccl 40:21\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(21,40,21)\">Eccl 40:21</ref> +); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Judg 5:12\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,12)\">Judg 5:12</ref> +, construct <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:27\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,27)\">2Chr 29:27</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>שִׁירִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 28:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,28,7)\">Ps 28:7</ref>, etc.; plural <bdbheb>שִׁירִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 13:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,13,8)\">1Chr 13:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 1:1\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(22,1,1)\">Song 1:1</ref> <bdbheb>שִׁרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 31:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,27)\">Gen 31:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 25:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,20)\">Prov 25:20</ref> suffix <bdbheb>שִׁרֶ֫יךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 5:23\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,23)\">Amos 5:23</ref>, etc.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> lyric <highlight>song</highlight>, + <bdbheb>מָשָׁל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:12\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,12)\">1Kgs 5:12</ref>, opposed to <bdbheb>קִינָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 8:10\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,10)\">Amos 8:10</ref> joyous <ref ref=\"Gen 31:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,27)\">Gen 31:27</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Isa 30:29\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,29)\">Isa 30:29</ref> <bdbheb>עגבים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 33:32\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(26,33,32)\">Ezek 33:32</ref> triumphal <ref ref=\"Judg 5:12\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,12)\">Judg 5:12</ref> love song <ref ref=\"Song 1:1\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(22,1,1)\">Song 1:1</ref> (twice in verse) (title <bdbheb>שִׁיר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הַשִּׁירִים</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 45:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,1)\">Ps 45:1</ref> (<bdbheb>שִׁיר יְדִידֹת</bdbheb>); noisy <ref ref=\"Amos 5:23\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,23)\">Amos 5:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,13)\">Ezek 26:13</ref>, in drunken revels <ref ref=\"Isa 24:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,24,9)\">Isa 24:9</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 23:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,23,16)\">Isa 23:16</ref> <bdbheb>כסילים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 7:5\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(21,7,5)\">Eccl 7:5</ref> not for sorrow <ref ref=\"Prov 25:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,20)\">Prov 25:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 137:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"137\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"137\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,137,3)\">Ps 137:3</ref> (twice in verse); <bdbheb>בְּנוֺת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הַשִּׁיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:4\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,4)\">Eccl 12:4</ref> <highlight>songstresses</highlight> (probably birds). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> religious <highlight>song</highlight>, in worship, || <bdbheb>תפלה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 42:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,42,9)\">Ps 42:9</ref> usually praise, <bdbheb>הלל בשׁיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 69:31\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"69\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"69\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(19,69,31)\">Ps 69:31</ref> <bdbheb>מִשִּׁירִי אֲהוֺדֶנּוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 28:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,28,7)\">Ps 28:7</ref> <bdbheb>שִׁרִ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>תְּהִלָּה וְהוֺדוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 12:46\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,46)\">Neh 12:46</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁיר י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 137:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"137\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"137\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,137,4)\">Ps 137:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:27\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,27)\">2Chr 29:27</ref> <bdbheb>שׁיר חדשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 42:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,10)\">Isa 42:10</ref> (fresh outburst), + 6 t., see  <bdbheb><reflink>חָדָשׁ</reflink></bdbheb>; in Psalm-titles, <bdbheb>שׁיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 46:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,46,1)\">Isa 46:1</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 26:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,1)\">Isa 26:1</ref> <bdbheb>שׁיר המעלות</bdbheb> <highlight>pilgrim songs</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 120:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"120\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"120\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,120,1)\">Ps 120:1</ref> + 14 t. (see II. <bdbheb>מַעִַלָה</bdbheb> p.752); with <bdbheb>מִמְוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 48:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=